== Payment of firm debts  [Sec. 49] <49>

where there are joint debts due from the firm and also separate debts due from any partner, 

*the property of the firm* -

1.  payment of the dues of the firm. 
2. If there is any surplus then the share of each partner #footnote[share of each partner means his capital contribution and surplus. Partners Advances are already paid sec. 48] shall be applied in payment of his separate debts or paid to him.

*The separate property of any partner* -

1. payment of his separate debts and
2. the surplus, if any, for the payment of firm's debt.

#block[In short, whose property? their creditor first. Then only cross liability kicks in.]